    <item>
      <pubDate>Wed, 22 Mar 2023 08:40:12 -0500</pubDate>
      <title>Tomorrow: State of the City Community Night - Milo-Grogan</title>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">55514842</guid>
      <link>https://content.govdelivery.com/accounts/OHCCC/bulletins/34f16da</link>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" class="gd_tbl_wrap"><tr><td style="background-color: #dddddd; margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100% !important" bgcolor="#dddddd"><table class="main-table" width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" id="yahoo" style="width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td style="padding: 15px 0 20px;" class="mobile-padding">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="background-color: #FFF; border-collapse: collapse;">

<tr>
<td id="header-bg" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Header Background" style="border-left-style: none; border-right-style: none; border-top-style: none; background-color: #00539b;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-header" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Header" align="center" style="background-color: #00539b; padding: 0px;" bgcolor="#00539b">
<img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/03/7279237/2023sotc-communitynight-milo-grogran_original.png" style="width: 600px; height: auto !important; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="Text: State of the city community night - milo-grogan. Picture of Boys and Girls Clubs of Central Ohio gymnasium" width="600" height="213">
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

<tr>
<td>
<table class="main-table" width="100%" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
<tr>
<td id="main-body" width="100%" data-govdstyle="all" data-govdtitle="Main Body" style="padding: 20px;">
<h1 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #00539b; font-size: 26px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">STATE OF THE CITY: MILO-GROGAN COMMUNITY NIGHT</h1>
<h2 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #d3222a; font-size: 18px; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="center">Thursday, March 23, 2023<br>6:00PM - 7:30PM<br>Boys &amp; Girls Clubs of Central Ohio<br>1000 Cleveland Ave, Columbus, OH 43201</h2>
<p class="gd_p" style="text-align: start; line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;" align="start">Mayor Andrew J. Ginther invites you to attend the State of the City: Milo-Grogan Community Night as he shares accomplishments and future initiatives in your community. Please join us for dinner and an opportunity to speak with the Mayor and city department representatives.</p>
<table class="gd_combo_table" width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse;">
  <tr>
    <td>
      <img class="govd_template_image" src="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/fancy_images/OHCCC/2023/03/7308550/4628906/roguefitnesslot_crop.jpg" style="width: 280px; height: auto !important; float: right; max-height: auto !important; border: none;" alt="aerial map of Rogue fitness" width="280" height="121" align="right" hspace="7">
      <p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">Attendees may use the Rogue Fitness parking lot at 1011 Cleveland Ave.</p>
<p style="line-height: 1.4; font-family: Calibri, Candara, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; margin: 0 0 10px;">In case you missed it, watch the 2023 State of the City address on <a href="https://youtu.be/e4rNmT5net8?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">Youtube</a> or read the <a href="https://www.columbus.gov/Templates/Detail.aspx?id=2147529589&utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #0062B2; text-decoration: underline; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none;">transcript</a>.</p>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
<h3 style="text-align: center; line-height: 1.1; font-weight: bold; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; font-size: 16px; margin: 30px 0;" align="center"><a href="https://www.columbus.gov/Milogroganrsvp/?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: none; -ms-word-break: break-all; word-break: break-word; -webkit-hyphens: none; -moz-hyphens: none; hyphens: none; background-color: #00539b; border-radius: 3px; border-color: #00539b; border-style: solid; border-width: 12px 25px;">RSVP</a></h3>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table>
</td>
</tr>

</table></td></tr></table>]]>
      </description>
